The legal text is the Constitution of Eritrea (ratified 23 May 1997), English text, from WIPO Lex (https://www.wipo.int/wipolex/en/legislation/details/8937), an intergovernmental host. The Penal Code, the Criminal Procedure Code and the Civil Procedure Code of the State of Eritrea (2015), English text of the Ministry of Justice editions, are from Refworld (UNHCR), https://www.refworld.org/, the host of the copies.

Official legislative texts are outside Eritrean copyright. Civil Code of the State of Eritrea (2015), Article 1161: "Official texts of a legislative, administrative or judicial nature shall not be subject to the provisions of this Title. They may be freely reproduced." (Article 1651 of the 1993 Provisional Civil Code was to the same effect.)

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the
tools) are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
